Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix(tui/sync):=20=E7=BC=93=E5=86=B2=20fire-and-?=
 =?UTF-8?q?forget=20=E7=AB=9E=E6=80=81=E4=B8=AD=E4=B8=A2=E5=BC=83=E7=9A=84?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20delta=EF=BC=8C=E6=81=A2=E5=A4=8D=E5=AD=90=E4=BC=9A=E8=AF=9D?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E8=BF=9B=E5=85=A5=E5=89=8D=E7=9A=84=E6=B5=81=E5=BC=8F=E6=96=87?=
